{
  "name": "Cool Cast Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This skill only produces an effect when you have at least one empty [Hand Slot]. You may reduce the [Hate] cost for &laquo;Spell Maximize&raquo; &laquo;Death Cloud&raquo; by -1 (minimum 0).</p>\n<p>(SR2): During Preplay, select one [Magic Attack] skill you know. Until the end of the scenario, that skill's [Hate] cost is reduced by -1 (minimum 0).</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A combat style that omits the chanting of magic by cutting the curse mark with one free hand.</p>",
